{"title":"Mirehide Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 33) · Monster drop: Glimmerfox, Luna Moth, Mother Brack, The Sea Witch, Ogre Butcher, Ogre Mauler</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 33 <span class=\"muted\">(1041 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/bog-pelt\">Bog Pelt</a>, 3× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate-sea-witch\" title=\"Mother Brack, The Sea Witch - dropped it in 1 of 3 looted corpses (1/3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8193c37ec86184d63047.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mother Brack, The Sea Witch</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glimmerfox\" title=\"Glimmerfox - dropped it in 2 of 463 looted corpses (1/232)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7418be6744e1d02a8b58.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/232<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"luna-moth\" title=\"Luna Moth - dropped it in 1 of 291 looted corpses (1/291)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b4c44c77eff00cb465.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/291<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 694 looted corpses (1/694)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/694<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 1,159 looted corpses (1/1,159)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,159<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"mirehide-arms\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/bog-pelt\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/851eda3e442f3ed8925d.svg\" alt=\"\">Bog Pelt</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/2e5e6d2e3aca8a0aa90d.svg\" alt=\"Mirehide Arms\"></div><h3>Mirehide Arms</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tailoring 33</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>5 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/27/2026, 9:27:31 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}